Page 11606 gan: Found match for regex: <begin> * In standard written Irish, triggers {{ga-mut-link|l}} (except of ''d'', ''s'', ''t'') of unmodified nouns, e.g. {{m|ga|gan [[pingin|phingin]]|t=without a penny}}. Does not trigger lenition of modified nouns, e.g. {{m|ga|gan pingin ina [[póca|phóca]]|t=without a penny in his pocket}}. In the meaning ‘not’, does not trigger lenition of either a verbal noun or on the direct object of the verbal noun, e.g. {{m|ga|gan [[ceannaigh|ceannach]]|t=not to buy}}, {{m|ga|gan [[pingin]] a shaothrú|t=not to earn a penny}}. <end>
